#-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomUniversalDesignSystemPlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Extend canonical Umicom::ui with typed design tokens, semantic component
#   specifications, responsive rules and cross-application design contracts.
#
# ARCHITECTURE:
#   Existing Umicom UI/component/workbench targets remain authoritative. This
#   layer adds semantic design data before GTK4, Qt6 and Native Web renderers.
